  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6348.01 Purpose. The purpose is to identify the qualifications and compliance requirements to become a provider of health care or laboratory services for the division for children, youth and families (DCYF).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6348) #9267, eff 9-20-08; ss by #12127, eff 3-10-17",
